{title: In My Heart There Rings a Melody}
{artist: Elton Roth}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 96}

Verse 1
I [G]have a song that [C]Jesus [G]gave me — it was sent from heaven a[D]bove;
[G]there never was a [C]sweeter [G]melody, 'tis a melody [D]of [G]love.

Chorus
[G]In my heart there [C]rings a melo[G]dy, there rings a melody with [A]heaven's harmo[D]ny;
[G]in my heart there [C]rings a melo[G]dy — there [D]rings a melody of [G]love.
